{"id":"CVE-2015-5352","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"mitre","published":"2015-08-03T00:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T06:41:09.541Z","description":"The x11_open_helper function in channels.c in ssh in OpenSSH before 6.9, when ForwardX11Trusted mode is not used, lacks a check of the refusal deadline for X connections, which makes it easier for remote attackers to bypass intended access restrictions via a connection outside of the permitted time window.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-2710-2","tags":["vendor-advisory"],"name":"USN-2710-2"},{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/linuxbulletinapr2016-2952096.html"},{"url":"https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20181023-0001/"},{"url":"https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/201512-04","tags":["vendor-advisory"],"name":"GLSA-201512-04"},{"url":"https://anongit.mindrot.org/openssh.git/commit/?h=V_6_9&id=1bf477d3cdf1a864646d59820878783d42357a1d"},{"url":"http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2015/07/01/10","tags":["mailing-list"],"name":"[oss-security] 20150701 Re: CVE Request: two security issues in openSSH 6.9"},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2016-0741.html","tags":["vendor-advisory"],"name":"RHSA-2016:0741"},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/75525","tags":["vdb-entry"],"name":"75525"},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1032797","tags":["vdb-entry"],"name":"1032797"},{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/bulletinjan2016-2867206.html"},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2015-09/msg00017.html","tags":["vendor-advisory"],"name":"SUSE-SU-2015:1581"},{"url":"http://www.openssh.com/txt/release-6.9"},{"url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/09/msg00010.html","tags":["mailing-list"],"name":"[debian-lts-announce] 20180910 [SECURITY] [DLA 1500-1] openssh security update"},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/us